  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA consisting of NNN integers.\n\nFor each KKK from 000 to NNN find the **maximum** prefix sum of AAA after changing the sign of **at most** KKK elements of the array.\n\nFormally:\n\nLet F(A)F(A)F(A) denote the **maximum** prefix sum of an array AAA of length NNN (including an empty array for which prefix sum is 000).\nThus, F(A)F(A)F(A) = max⁡(0,&nbsp;max⁡1≤i≤N∑j=1iAj)\\max(0,\\ \\max_{1 \\le i \\le N} \\sum_{j=1}^{i}A_j )max(0,&nbsp;max1≤i≤N​∑j=1i​Aj​).\n\nLet G(K)G(K)G(K) denote the **maximum** possible value of F(A)F(A)F(A) after applying the following operation **at most** KKK times:\n\n\nChoose an index iii (1≤i≤N)(1 \\le i \\le N)(1≤i≤N) and change the sign of ithi^{th}ith element of array, i.e., set Ai=&nbsp;−AiA_i =\\ -A_iAi​=&nbsp;−Ai​.\nFor each KKK from 000 to NNN, find G(K)G(K)G(K).\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains a single integer TTT - the number of test cases. Then the test cases follow.\nThe first line of each test case contains an integer NNN - the size of the array AAA.\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers A1A_1A1​, A2A_2A2​, …\\ldots…, ANA_NAN​ denoting the array AAA.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the N+1N+1N+1 integers G(0),G(1),…,G(N)G(0), G(1), \\ldots, G(N)G(0),G(1),…,G(N) - the maximum prefix sum of AAA after changing the sign of **at most** KKK elements.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\le T \\le 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\le N \\le 10^51≤N≤105",
      "−109≤Ai≤109-10^9 \\le A_i \\le 10^9−109≤Ai​≤109",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases doesn't exceed 10510^5105."
    ],
