        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111:\n\nFor K=0K = 0K=0: Maximum prefix sum with 000 changes is −3+4=1-3+4 = 1−3+4=1.\nFor K=1K = 1K=1: Maximum prefix sum with 111 change is 3+4=73+4 = 73+4=7. Note that we changed A1A_1A1​ from −3-3−3 to 333.\nFor K=2K = 2K=2: Maximum prefix sum with 222 change is 3+4+2=93+4+2 = 93+4+2=9. Note that we changed A1A_1A1​ from −3-3−3 to 333 and A3A_3A3​ from −2-2−2 to 222.\nFor K=3,4,K = 3, 4,K=3,4, and 555: Maximum prefix sum is 3+4+2+3+1=133+4+2+3+1 = 133+4+2+3+1=13. Note that we changed A1A_1A1​ from −3-3−3 to 333, A3A_3A3​ from −2-2−2 to 222, and A4A_4A4​ from −3-3−3 to 333.\n\nTest case 222:\n\nFor K=0K = 0K=0: Maximum prefix sum with 000 changes is 000 where we choose an empty prefix.\nFor K=1K = 1K=1: Maximum prefix sum with 111 changes is 888. We change the value of A1A_1A1​ from −8-8−8 to 888.\nFor K=2K = 2K=2: Maximum prefix sum with 222 changes is 8+5=138+5 = 138+5=13. We change the value of A1A_1A1​ from −8-8−8 to 888 and A2A_2A2​ from −5-5−5 to 555.\nFor K=3K = 3K=3: Maximum prefix sum with 333 changes is 8+5+2=158+5+2 = 158+5+2=15. We change the value of A1A_1A1​ from −8-8−8 to 888, A2A_2A2​ from −5-5−5 to 555, and A3A_3A3​ from −2-2−2 to 222."
